% line 99-124
% four drive description
a vehicle drives to a new place through a route from a first time to the first time if
the route starts from a street with a direction
and the vehicle is at the new place heading the direction at the first time.

a vehicle drives to a third place through a route from a first time to a third time if 
the route starts from a street with a direction 
and the vehicle is at a first place heading the direction at the first time
and the first place is different from a third place
and the first place is next to a second place along the direction
and the second place is on the street
and the vehicle steps from the first place to the second place from the first time to a second time
and the vehicle drives to the third place through the route from the second time to the third time
and the vehicle is at the new place heading the direction at the third time.


a vehicle drives to a third place through a route from a first time to a third time if 
the route starts from a first street with a first direction
and the route has as second a third street with a third direction
and the vehicle is at a first place heading the first direction at the first time
and the first place is next to a second place along the first direction
and it is not the case that the second place is on the third street
and the vehicle steps from the first place to the second place from the first time to a second time and the vehicle drives to the third place through the route from the second time to the third time
and the vehicle is at the new place heading the direction at the third time.


a vehicle drives to a third place through a first route from a first time to a third time if 
the first route starts from a first street with a first direction
and the first route has as second a third street with a third direction
and the first route has as tail a second route
and the vehicle is at a first place heading the first direction at the first time
and the first place is next to a second place along the first direction
and the second place is on the third street
and the vehicle steps from the first place to the second place from the first time to a second time
and the vehicle turns to the third direction from the first time to the second time
and a third route starts from the third street with the third direction
and the third route has as tail the second route 
and the vehicle drives to the third place through the third route from the second time to the third time
and the vehicle is at the new place heading the direction at the third time.

