the horizontal coordinate of the first place is a first number
and the vertical coordinate of the first place is a second number
and the horizontal coordinate of the second place is the first number
and the vertical coordinate of the second place is a third number
and the third number is the second number plus 1.

a first place is next to a second place along southward if
the horizontal coordinate of the first place is a first number
and the vertical coordinate of the first place is a second number
and the horizontal coordinate of the second place is the first number
and the vertical coordinate of the second place is a third number
and the third number is the second number minus 1.

a first place is next to a second place along southward if
the horizontal coordinate of the first place is a first number
and the vertical coordinate of the first place is a second number
and the horizontal coordinate of the second place is a third number
and the vertical coordinate of the second place is the second number
and the third number is the first number plus 1.

a first place is next to a second place along southward if
